<title>UK: Rabobank unit sets NZ$100 mln 3-year bond.</title>
<headline>Rabobank unit sets NZ$100 mln 3-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Toronto Dominion and Rabobank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RABOBANK AUSTRALIA LTD</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  RABOBANK NETHERLANDS</p>
<p> AMT    NZ$100 MLN    COUPON     8.0 PCT   MATURITY    23.MAY.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.985   PAY DATE    23.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS</p>
<p>US/UK/NZ/AU</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  1.0	 PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
